  "description": "A FEEL (Friendly Enough Expression Language) parser and interpreter for .NET.\n      FEEL is used in DMN (Decision Model and Notation) and provides expression evaluation capabilities.\n      This package offers a C#-friendly API built on a high-performance F# implementation.\n      \n      🏆 100% FEEL specification compliance (1,216/1,216 tests passing)\n      🎯 NEW: Qualified function invocation (library.method() syntax)\n      🚀 Revolutionary dual-mode error handling\n      ⚡ Method-to-property access for seamless .NET integration\n      📚 Complete documentation: https://glittery-semolina-0ce4cd.netlify.app",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
  "id": "FeelSharp",
