  "published": "2025-08-23T21:06:35.64Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Version 1.2.0 - 🚀 QUALIFIED FUNCTION INVOCATION: Enhanced Method Call Support! \n\n🎯 NEW: Qualified Function Invocation Support\n✅ Standard dot notation: library.sumFn(1, 2, 3) - Now fully supported!\n✅ DMN-style syntax: fn library.sumFn(1, 2, 3) - Enhanced compatibility  \n✅ Method calls on path expressions - Complete parser architecture improvement\n✅ Backward compatible - All existing property access (.property) still works perfectly\n\n🔧 Technical Improvements:\n✅ Enhanced postfix parser with intelligent precedence handling\n✅ Method call detection with automatic fallback to property access\n✅ Perfect test coverage: 1,216/1,216 tests passing (100%)\n✅ FEEL TCK compliance: 39/39 tests passing (100%)\n\n🎉 World-class FEEL engine with complete function invocation patterns!",
